  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "What these slides are for",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>These slides name phones in Fleet's console by hand, for when the connector cannot be used. It takes technical staff, one phone at a time.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f9ad8e2eb9cf167a.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open enrolment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Deploy App, open <strong>User Management</strong>, then <strong>MDM</strong>, and press <strong>Open for 2 hours</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/da96e1bc702c9eef.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 889
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copy the challenge",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Press the copy mark beside <strong>Challenge</strong>. It is new for every opening, so your MDM needs it each time.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8804c0942a9ec47e.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1125
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Give Fleet the challenge",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet: <strong>Settings</strong>, <strong>Integrations</strong>, <strong>Certificate enrollment</strong>. Edit your Deploy App's authority, paste the challenge and press <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/bbabdb48fd4be54d.webp",
              "width": 1860,
              "height": 1368
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the phone in Fleet, choose <strong>Edit user</strong>, type its callsign and <strong>Save</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/864752cd63281309.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1150
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send its certificate",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the same page open <strong>OS settings</strong> and choose <strong>Resend</strong> on the <strong>rmscep</strong> row: naming alone sends nothing.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f02b4ebe7e64ac97.webp",
              "width": 1820,
              "height": 634
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send the policy again",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Once every phone has its apps, delete the policy under <strong>Controls</strong>, <strong>OS settings</strong>, <strong>Configuration profiles</strong> and add it again, so Chrome may use the certificate. Then press <strong>Close</strong> in Deploy App and see <strong>First start on the phone</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/11dfb2b661af7839.webp",
              "width": 1920,
              "height": 751
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
